===Noun===
{{es-noun|f}}

# [[victim]]

===Notes===
Víctima is one of the few Spanish nouns that does not have a masculine equivalent. Even male victims are considered to be female, grammatically speaking. (This was due to how victims were not people originally.)

The same holds true for most translations of victim in other languages, including Portuguese {{m|pt|vítima}} and Italian {{m|it|vittima}}.

